// IR5.5: the feature menu's Dynamic suppression ▸ Suppress by variable…, on a 60 × 40 × 10 plate
// with a Ø16 hole (Extrude 2, Remove) and a Number Variable #withHole = 1 (`with-hole`).
// 01 the plate with its hole; the Variable table (right) shows #withHole = 1.
// 02 right-click Extrude 2 ▸ Dynamic suppression: Suppress by variable… enabled (Suppress by
//    configuration stays disabled: configurations are out of scope).
// 03 Suppress by variable…: the dialog lists the variables above Extrude 2 (#withHole (1)), with
//    "Suppress when true (not 0)" unchecked; the hint says Extrude 2 is suppressed while it is 0.
// 03b the box ticked: the hint reads the inverted rule ("… while the variable is not 0 (true).");
//    unticked again before OK.
// 04 OK: Extrude 2's row carries a "#withHole" tag; #withHole is 1, so the hole is still cut.
// 05 #withHole typed as 0 in the Variable table: Extrude 2 greys and is struck through like a
//    suppressed feature, and the hole is gone.
// 06 the tag's tooltip: "Suppressed while #withHole is 0 (false) · currently suppressed".
// 07 #withHole back to 1: Extrude 2 builds again, the hole is back.
// 07b right-click Extrude 2 ▸ Dynamic suppression: with a binding set, the submenu adds
//    "Remove suppression variable" (closed again with Escape).
// 08 #withHole 0 again, then Dynamic suppression ▸ Remove suppression variable: the tag is gone
//    and the hole is cut although #withHole is 0.
// 09 Ctrl+Z undoes the removal (one step): the binding is back, Extrude 2 suppressed, no hole.
// 10 Extrude 2 renamed to a long name: the name ends in "…" before the tag, which stays whole
//    inside the list.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(30),
        Custom("with-hole"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(ui("panel-variables")),
        WaitFor("variables-panel"),
        Wait(10),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Wait(40),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(40),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-plate-with-hole"),
        RightClick(ui("feature-extrude-2")),
        WaitFor("feature-context-menu"),
        Wait(3),
        Hover(ui("feature-dynamic-suppression")),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(ui("feature-suppress-by-variable")),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-dynamic-suppression"),
        Click(ui("feature-suppress-by-variable")),
        WaitFor("suppress-variable-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-dialog"),
        Click(ui("suppress-variable-invert")),
        Wait(5),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03b-dialog-inverted"),
        Click(ui("suppress-variable-invert")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("suppress-variable-ok")),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-bound"),
        Click(ui("variable-row-withHole-field")),
        Wait(2),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("0"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(60),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-with-hole-0"),
        Hover(ui("feature-extrude-2-suppression-variable")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("06-tag-tooltip"),
        Click(ui("variable-row-withHole-field")),
        Wait(2),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("1"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(60),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-with-hole-1"),
        RightClick(ui("feature-extrude-2")),
        WaitFor("feature-context-menu"),
        Wait(3),
        Hover(ui("feature-dynamic-suppression")),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(ui("feature-remove-suppression-variable")),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07b-remove-item"),
        Key("Escape"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("variable-row-withHole-field")),
        Wait(2),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("0"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(60),
        RightClick(ui("feature-extrude-2")),
        WaitFor("feature-context-menu"),
        Wait(3),
        Hover(ui("feature-dynamic-suppression")),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("feature-remove-suppression-variable")),
        Wait(60),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-removed"),
        Key("Ctrl+Z"),
        Wait(60),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-undo-removal"),
        RightClick(ui("feature-extrude-2")),
        WaitFor("feature-context-menu"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("feature-rename")),
        Wait(5),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("Through hole for the mounting bolt"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-long-name"),
    ],
)
